  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility studies and market entry in Colombia for exporting coffee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tropiq AS (established 2016) is a coffee trading company solely focusing on value-added, high quality, and traceable coffees from certain origins. Tropiq&apos;s service began as the sourcing department for Nordic Approach AS, and was later established as a separate company in 2017. The project comprises of feasibility studies and market entry in Colombia (including establishment in Bogota, training and capacity building). Tropiq aims to set-up sub-units in the main coffee producing regions. For the sub-units, Tropiq will hire and engage local staff, which will work to facilitate the sourcing of raw materials, quality control, supply chain management monitoring, and the deployment of knowledge from coffee experts such as agronomists.</narrative>
  </description>
